{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digisophie",
 "version": "1.2.0",
 "title": "SOPHIE",
 "description": "Two-operator metallic percussion adaptation of Sophie with four distinct models. Its audio enters the normal Digitakt AMP, filter, mixer and sends; the source filter and drive are intentionally not ported. Its SRC and LFO pages are drawn by machine-pages (core 3.0), so it shares a build with the other machines made for it.",
 "category": "Synthesis",
 "author": "digisophie contributors",
 "license": "MIT",
